{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103230","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1410323001:0":{"text":"エイン、キミはそんなことでボクたちを呼んだのかい？","source_cn":"奎茵，你把所有人都叫来，竟然只为了这点小事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0919F0D3946848FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410323002:1":{"text":"サリエ殿、これは王都の安全に関わる問題。気を抜いてはいけませんぞ。","source_cn":"沙利叶，事关萨洛克兰的安危，不能掉以轻心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59C703AB1F2E667","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410323003:0":{"text":"やれやれ、門番というのはよっぽど楽な仕事らしいね。ボクは余計なことを考える暇もないぐらい忙しいというのに。","source_cn":"哎呀，真羡慕你，正因为做着守门人这种闲差事，才有精力对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26C1386BEAB780F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410323004:0":{"text":"管轄外のことにまで首を突っ込んでないで、門番は門番らしく扉を守ってなよ。望まぬ場所にネズミが入り込んだら、困るのはキミだろう？","source_cn":"劝你还是安心守好的你的门，王城里的事少插嘴。要是真有什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3471D70492414E62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410323005:0":{"text":"女王陛下のご子息の発言とは思えませんな……貴殿には、サロクディアを守る者としての自覚はないのですか？","source_cn":"沙利叶，我常常怀疑你到底是不是女王陛下的儿子，你心里究...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA0B8A962416A496","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fe